# Styling

## Utilities
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` to merge classes
- CVA for component variants (`buttonVariants`, `badgeVariants`)
- Design tokens in `tailwind.config.ts` — no magic hex in components

## Tailwind
- Mobile-first responsive prefixes
- Consistent spacing scale (4, 6, 8, 16, 24)
- Custom animations in `tailwind.config.ts` keyframes

## CSS
- Global styles only in `globals.css` (tokens, base, glass utilities)
- No CSS modules unless exception documented
- Prefer Tailwind over inline styles

## Themes
```tsx
className="bg-background text-foreground"
className="dark:bg-primary-950"
```
Use semantic color names, not raw colors in components.
